  "summary": "UltiMaker Cura 是一款面向 3D 打印爱好者和专业人士的开源桌面切片应用程序。它将 STL/3MF/OBJ 等 3D 模型文件转换为 3D 打印机可执行的 G-code，提供丰富的打印参数设置（数百项可调参数）、多语言界面、插件扩展系统以及 UltiMaker 云服务集成（云端打印、数字工厂、备份同步）。基于 UltiMaker Uranium 框架（PyQt6 + QML）构建，内置 OpenGL 3D 预览视图，支持 Windows/macOS/Linux 跨平台。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "3D 模型切片",
      "description": "将 STL、3MF、OBJ 等 3D 模型文件导入后，通过 CuraEngine 后端将模型切层并生成 G-code 打印指令，支持自定义层高、填充密度、支撑结构、打印速度等数百项参数。",
      "evidence": ["cura/CuraApplication.py", "plugins/CuraEngineBackend/CuraEngineBackend.py", "plugins/CuraEngineBackend/StartSliceJob.py"]
    },
    {
      "name": "3D 预览与视图",
      "description": "基于 PyQt6 + QML 的图形界面，内建 OpenGL 3D 渲染视图，支持模型的旋转/缩放/平移、多视角（实体视图/SolidView、仿真视图/SimulationView、X 射线视图/XRayView）、颜色映射与图层预览。",
      "evidence": ["cura/BuildVolume.py", "cura/CuraView.py", "cura/PreviewPass.py", "plugins/SolidView/SolidView.py", "plugins/SimulationView/SimulationView.py"]
    },
    {
      "name": "打印参数管理",
      "description": "完善的打印机/材料/喷嘴配置管理：打印机定义与变体、材料品牌与类型、打印质量 profile（精细/标准/粗糙）、意图（视觉/工程/快速）、自定义设置覆盖、多挤出机管理、设置可见性与继承。",
      "evidence": ["cura/Settings/MachineManager.py", "cura/Settings/ExtruderManager.py", "cura/Settings/IntentManager.py", "cura/Settings/ContainerManager.py", "cura/Machines/Models/"]
    },
    {
      "name": "插件系统",
      "description": "丰富的内置插件生态，涵盖文件读写（3MF/AMF/GCode/UFP/STL/OBJ/图像）、网络打印连接（UM3 Network Printing、USB 打印）、云服务（CuraDrive 备份同步、Digital Library 数字工厂、Marketplace 插件市场）、后处理脚本（PauseAtHeight/ChangeAtZ 等 20+ 种）、固件更新、模型检查等。",
      "evidence": ["plugins/3MFReader/", "plugins/GCodeWriter/", "plugins/UM3NetworkPrinting/", "plugins/USBPrinting/", "plugins/CuraDrive/", "plugins/DigitalLibrary/", "plugins/Marketplace/", "plugins/PostProcessingPlugin/"]
    },
